    "hint_texts": "This feature focuses on enhancing and updating the test infrastructure to support the new serialization logic. Developers should update test files to ensure that the output of exception reporting reflects the full chain of exceptions. In particular, legacy testing helpers need to be replaced by improved fixtures and any hardcoded references to older behaviors must be removed. The tests across various modules (code, excinfo, reports, and others) must be adjusted so that they continue to pass and validate that all exception chaining scenarios (with and without the 'from' clause) are correctly handled.",
